        "text": "☰\nHome\nDonate\nSign Up\nAbout\nContact\nPartners\nLogin\nSupport Teachers, Empower Futures!\n\nConnecting generous donors with teachers in need of classroom supplies.\n\nFind Teachers to Support\n\nOUR IMPACT SO FAR\n\nEvery number is a classroom transformed\n\nVERIFIED TEACHERS\n\n150+\n\nEducators with active profiles ready for support\n\nTOTAL DONATIONS\n\n$9.3k\n\nRaised by generous donors for classroom supplies\n\nSCHOOLS REACHED\n\n135+\n\nSchools with at least one supported teacher\n\nTeacher of the Day\nSarah Endsley\n\nfrom ROCHESTER PRIMARY SCHOOL in THURSTON COUNTY, Washington\n\nView Teacher of the Day\nAre You a Teacher?\n\nIf you're an educator in need of support, register to create your profile.\n\nRegister\nDonate Directly to Us\n\nClick the button below if you would like to make a direct donation to Homeroom Heroes:\n\nDonate\nFind a Random Teacher\n\nDiscover a teacher at random and make a positive impact on their classroom.\n\nFind Random Teacher\n\n© 2024 Homeroom Heroes. All rights reserved."
